{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aChain Letter\u300b is a grid-based control roguelite defense game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine friend skills to complete your own skill build, and hold back waves of demons within a fixed grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear 4 stages and unlock 31 friend skills to form your own party\u2014then dive into this chaotic battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/be43547f75b6054d487508d130dde26f.poster.avif?t=1770488452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/be43547f75b6054d487508d130dde26f.webm?t=1770488452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/be43547f75b6054d487508d130dde26f.mp4?t=1770488452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-based control:</strong> Thrilling combat where dodging and execution decide victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive hands-on feel</strong>: The more you master it, the more insanely satisfying it gets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friend skill combos:</strong> Unlock 31 skills and craft your own build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and fast runs</strong>: Optimized for repeat play with a brisk pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 stages:</strong> Tougher enemies and new patterns as you progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/ec399d031444e42229a102f04e0b4af4.poster.avif?t=1770488452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/ec399d031444e42229a102f04e0b4af4.webm?t=1770488452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/ec399d031444e42229a102f04e0b4af4.mp4?t=1770488452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sometimes powerful foes will appear\u2014sometimes overwhelming bullet storms will rain down.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the chaos, you must move quickly within the grid and use your skills to hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each \u201cfriend skill\u201d has its own unique command, and the more you get used to the controls, the more satisfying it feels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather different types of skills (summons, rapid strikes, AoE, buffs) create your own combinations, and even if you fail, try again and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the demons that keep surging in, all the way to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/f21b3febefce1bf062ceeb0302377042.poster.avif?t=1770488452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/f21b3febefce1bf062ceeb0302377042.webm?t=1770488452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/f21b3febefce1bf062ceeb0302377042.mp4?t=1770488452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the protagonist \u201cMongsil,\u201d caught in a mysterious incident, and must escape a world that repeats for unknown reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this hellish world, a magical letter is the key element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The letter is used to unlock friends sealed by a curse, or to strengthen skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you unlock every friend and escape this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the letter, unlock and upgrade your friends, and push toward the exit from hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821290?t=1770488452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821290?t=1770488452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/1965af8871cd7ca81744d01a46493d92df1fd9df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770488452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/1965af8871cd7ca81744d01a46493d92df1fd9df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770488452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Chain Letter is a cute rhythm action game that gently explores emotional themes such as isolation, loss, and the fear of disconnection. \r\n\r\nWhile the visuals are colorful and charming, some story cutscenes contain abstract imagery, glitch effects, and emotionally intense moments that may be unsettling for sensitive players. \r\n\r\nThe game does not contain blood, gore, or explicit content, but does address emotionally heavy topics through metaphor and symbolic storytelling."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aChain Letter\u300b is a grid-based control roguelite defense game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"b