>In this hellish world, a magical letter is the key element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The letter is used to unlock friends sealed by a curse, or to strengthen skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you unlock every friend and escape this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the letter, unlock and upgrade your friends, and push toward the exit from hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Jarikki Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/42bfb38fc33ab392983e16f307fe9465a91f6891/header.jpg?t=1770488452","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821290/1260506094/fbcd5a485b877cfb086294986fefe2332d6be3e1/1767862859/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767863839","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821290/1260506094/fbcd5a485b877cfb086294986fefe2332d6be3e1/1767862859/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767863839","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821290/1260506094/fbcd5a485b877cfb086294986fefe2332d6be3e1/1767862859/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767863839","id":257261538,"name":"ChainLetterTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257261538/e5dbcadecc188c42a816f5b6d4aab1a82e923686/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767863839"}],"name":"Chain Letter","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD 620 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 1